{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32645","headline":"夏日登慈恩寺 · 刘沧","name":"夏日登慈恩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金界时来一访僧，天香飘翠琐窗凝。\n碧池静照寒松影，清昼深悬古殿灯。\n晚景风蝉催节候，高空云鸟度轩层。\n尘机消尽话玄理，暮磬出林疎韵澄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}